sequenceDiagram
    %% End-to-End Request Lifecycle from Browser Click to UI Render

    autonumber
    actor User as User Browser
    participant ReactComp as React Component (e.g. CapTablePage)
    participant QueryHook as useQuery (React Query)
    participant Axios as Axios Client (src/lib/axios.ts)
    participant Traefik as Traefik Ingress (:443)
    participant Kestrel as Kestrel / ASP.NET Pipeline
    participant Controller as CompanyController (/api/company)
    participant Service as CompanyService.cs
    participant Repo as Phase4CapTables Store
    participant Mongo as MongoDB Atlas

    %% 1. Client Action
    User->>ReactComp: Click "View Cap Table" tab
    ReactComp->>QueryHook: Trigger useQuery(['cap-table', companyId])
    QueryHook->>Axios: api.get(`/company/${companyId}/cap-table`)

    %% 2. Client Transport & Interceptor
    Axios->>Axios: Interceptor: Read token from localStorage
    Axios->>Axios: Inject Header "Authorization: Bearer <jwt>"
    Axios->>Traefik: Send HTTPS GET /api/company/{id}/cap-table

    %% 3. Ingress & Pipeline
    Traefik->>Traefik: Terminate TLS (Let's Encrypt)
    Traefik->>Kestrel: Forward to healthy API replica (:8080)
    Kestrel->>Kestrel: ForwardedHeaders: Resolve real client IP
    Kestrel->>Kestrel: CorrelationIdMiddleware: Assign X-Correlation-ID
    Kestrel->>Kestrel: RateLimiter: Evaluate IP & Global fixed window
    Kestrel->>Kestrel: JwtBearerMiddleware: Validate token & map sub -> NameIdentifier
    Kestrel->>Controller: Route to GetCapTable(companyId)

    %% 4. Controller & Domain Logic
    Controller->>Service: GetCapTableAsync(companyId, currentUserId)
    Service->>Service: Ownership Assertion: AssertAccess(company.UserId == currentUserId)
    Service->>Repo: Find latest Phase4CapTable by CompanyId & Version desc
    Repo->>Mongo: Execute BSON query against Phase4CapTables collection
    Mongo-->>Repo: Return BSON Document
    Repo-->>Service: Hydrate Phase4CapTable model
    Service->>Service: Map to CapTableDto (calculate dilution percentages)
    Service-->>Controller: Return CapTableDto
    Controller-->>Kestrel: Return Ok(ApiResponse.Ok(dto))

    %% 5. Ingress & Response Compression
    Kestrel->>Kestrel: ResponseCompression: Compress body with Brotli
    Kestrel->>Traefik: HTTP 200 OK + Brotli payload
    Traefik-->>Axios: HTTP 200 OK

    %% 6. React Query & State Re-render
    Axios-->>QueryHook: Return response.data.data
    QueryHook->>QueryHook: Populate queryClient cache & set status = 'success'
    QueryHook-->>ReactComp: Trigger component re-render with fresh DTO
    ReactComp-->>User: Render Cap Table Grid & Stakeholder Shares
